  "title": "Partitioned ownership with full parameter reuse",
  "introduction": "Let $p_A$ and $p_B$ be parameter shards available as a full collection on each data-parallel process. Local backward passes produce gradient contributions; reduce-scatter sends each reduced shard to its owner, which applies its matching optimizer state. An all-gather then restores the updated full collection.",
