      "title": "Restore the full updated parameters",
      "explanation": "An all-gather copies the owner-updated shards $p_A$ and $p_B$ into the full parameter collection used by every process. Their identities persist through the copy. In the paper's volume model, gradient reduce-scatter moves $\\Psi$ elements and parameter all-gather moves another $\\Psi$, totaling the baseline $2\\Psi$ per step.",
